question.text:
**Write a description of a deserted playground at dusk.**

Write two or three paragraphs (around 150–250 words). Aim to:

- open with a wide view, then zoom in on one object;
- use at least two senses (not just sight);
- include a simile or metaphor;
- show the mood through detail rather than naming it;
- end by shifting the light or time.

*(In the exam this task would be worth 40 marks. Here it is checked against six key features.)*

